# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Arma Reforger server config archive
#
# Strategy: ignore EVERYTHING by default, then explicitly allow only the
# custom config / operator scripts / docs. This guarantees the ~40 GB of
# Steam-managed game data, Workshop mods, logs, crash dumps, engine binaries
# and the engine player-save can NEVER be committed — only re-downloadable
# content and runtime junk live in those paths, and a fresh Steam install
# regenerates them.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Ignore everything (each directory level must be re-ignored to reach
#    nested files we want to allow further down) ──
/*
profile_new/*
profile_new/profile/*

# ── Credentials that must NEVER be committed (also covered by the rule
#    above; listed explicitly as a tripwire) ──
profile_new/profile/ownerToken.bin

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ALLOW-LIST — everything below is un-ignored (later rules win)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Repo meta ──
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# ── Live + reference + deployed server configs ──
!/serverConfig.json
!/serverConfigDeployed.json
!/serverConfig.pre-restoration-2026-05-10.json

# ── Operator scripts ──
!/start_server.ps1
!/analyze_logs.ps1
!/mod_health_check.ps1
!/snapshot_state.ps1
!/restore_state.ps1
!/snapshot_agent.ps1
!/snapshot_agent_loop.cmd
!/_reorder_to_layers.ps1

# ── Operator docs / notes ──
!/CLAUDE.md
!/MASTER_OBJECTIVE.md
!/WORKBENCH_BRIDGE_MOD_PLAN.md
!/CONTEXT_PROMPT.md
!/GAME_HOST_BROS_DEPLOYMENT.md
!/HANDOFF_CONTEXT.md
!/LIVE_TEST_CASES.md
!/MOD_INGAME_GUIDE.md
!/SESSION_LOG_2026-05-13.md
!/context.md
!/experiment.md

# ── Custom doc dir + rollback snapshot history (small, config-only) ──
!/mod_docs/
!/state_snapshots/

# ── Per-mod server-side configs under the working profile ──
!profile_new/
!profile_new/profile/
!profile_new/profile/ServerAdminTools_Config.json
!profile_new/profile/ScenarioReloadMenu_Config.json
!profile_new/profile/CRX_EAI/
!profile_new/profile/GRS_ATAK/
!profile_new/profile/ATAK/
!profile_new/profile/DarcMods/
!profile_new/profile/WCS_LoadoutEditor/
